transcriptions support for {{Infobox Chinese/Arabic}}.  This function adds headers and label data pairs to
infobox_arg table according to which parameters are set

returns the enumerator in case it is needed

TODO: standardize on lowercase parameter names

]]

local function transcriptions_ar (infobox_args, args, show, i)
	if any_set ({args.chat, args.Chat, args['ala-lc'], args['ALA-LC'], args.iso, args.ISO, args.din, args.DIN}) then
		i = add_transcription (infobox_args, args, 'arabic', show, i);
